<title>USA: ADTRAN to supply HDSL to Bell Atlantic.</title>
<headline>ADTRAN to supply HDSL to Bell Atlantic.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTSVILLE, Ala. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADTRAN Inc said Monday it was selected by Bell Atlantic Corp's network services to supply high-bit rate digital subscriber line (HDSL) products.</p>
<p>The HDSL system makes existing infrastructure of copper wires perform high-speed digital transmission like fiber optics, the company said.</p>
<p>ADTRAN did not disclose details of the supply agreement.</p>
</text>
